"memory": "Round 1: Initial implementation of pipeline.js. processText calls injected tokenize, returns {text, tokens, count, unique, frequencies}. Frequencies uses Object.create(null) to handle prototype keys like 'constructor'. text = tokens.join(' '). tokens preserved in order. unique preserves first-seen order. No shadowing of normalize/tokenize. Ready for review.",
